line\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the poset and total-function predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ClosureOperatorOnPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ClosureOperatorOnPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operator\\text{-}on\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ClosureOperatorOnPoset}_S(c,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,P,P)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(x\\leq_P c(x)\\land(x\\leq_P y\\to c(x)\\leq_P c(y))\\land c(c(x))=c(x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}closure\\text{-}operator\\text{-}on\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ClosureOperatorOnPoset}_S(c,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,P,P)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(x\\leq_P c(x)\\land(x\\leq_P y\\to c(x)\\leq_P c(y))\\land c(c(x))=c(x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary closure operator definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{